This is the standard "longest substring without repeating characters" sliding window, with one line altered:

```java
Map<Character,Integer> last = new HashMap<>();
int left = 0, best = 0;
for (int right = 0; right < s.length(); right++) {
    char c = s.charAt(right);
    if (last.containsKey(c)) left = last.get(c) + 1;   // <-- altered line
    last.put(c, right);
    best = Math.max(best, right - left + 1);
}
return best;
```

